  "Id": 636,
  "Title": "Aga Khan University announced results of MBBS Part IV (final) examination 2007",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The students with following registration numbers are declared to have passed the MBBS Part IV Final Examination, held in September 2007.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>The students with following registration numbers are declared to have passed the MBBS Part IV Final Examination, held in September 2007:</p><p>M01026</p><p>M01059</p><p>M02001</p><p>M02002</p><p>M02003</p><p>M02004</p><p>M02006</p><p>M02008</p><p>M02009</p><p>M02010</p><p>M02012</p><p>M02013</p><p>M02015</p><p>M02016</p><p>M02017</p><p>M02019</p><p>M02020</p><p>M02021</p><p>M02022</p><p>M02023</p><p>M02024</p><p>M02025</p><p>M02026</p><p>M02027</p><p>M02029</p><p>M02030</p><p>M02031</p><p>M02032</p><p>M02033</p><p>M02034</p><p>M02035</p><p>M02036</p><p>M02037</p><p>M02038</p><p>M02039</p><p>M02040</p><p>M02041</p><p>M02042 </p><p>M02043</p><p>M02045</p><p>M02046</p><p>M02047</p><p>M02048</p><p>M02049</p><p>M02050</p><p>M02051</p><p>M02052</p><p>M02053</p><p>M02054</p><p>M02057</p><p>M02058</p><p>M02059</p><p>M02060</p><p>M02062</p><p>M02065</p><p>M02066</p><p>M02067</p><p>M02068</p><p>M02069</p><p>M02070</p><p>M02073</p><p>M02074</p><p>M02076</p><p>M02077</p><p>M02078</p><p>M02080</p><p>M02081</p><p>M02082</p><p>M02083</p><p>M02084</p><p>M02085</p><p>M02087</p><p>M02088</p><p>M02089</p><p>M02090 </p><p>Following students have passed the examination with Honours in subject(s) mentioned against their names:  </p><p>Ali Imran Amjad M02010 Surgery </p><p>Zuhaib Ibrahim M02026 Medicine </p><p>Sana Waheed M02080 Family Medicine </p><p>Asma Mushir Ahmad Khan M02088 Family Medicine </p><p>Fawad Muhammad Shuaib M02090 Family Medicine</p>",
